return ['domain'=>'woocommerce-multilingual','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_TW','project-id-version'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 5.6.0','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-12T13:36:01+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'YEAR-MO-DA HO:MI+ZONE','x-generator'=>'WP-CLI 2.12.0','messages'=>['WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce','https://wpml.org/documentation/wpml-core-and-add-on-plugins/woocommerce-multilingual/?utm_source=plugin&utm_medium=gui&utm_campaign=wcml'=>'https://wpml.org/documentation/wpml-core-and-add-on-plugins/woocommerce-multilingual/?utm_source=plugin&utm_medium=gui&utm_campaign=wcml','Make your store multilingual and enable multiple currencies | <a href="https://wpml.org/documentation/wpml-core-and-add-on-plugins/woocommerce-multilingual/?utm_source=plugin&utm_medium=gui&utm_campaign=wcml">Documentation</a>'=>'讓您的商店支援多語言並啟用多貨幣 | <a href="https://wpml.org/documentation/wpml-core-and-add-on-plugins/woocommerce-multilingual/?utm_source=plugin&utm_medium=gui&utm_campaign=wcml">說明文件</a>','OnTheGoSystems'=>'OnTheGoSystems','http://www.onthegosystems.com/'=>'http://www.onthegosystems.com/','Language of the content to read.'=>'要讀取的內容語言。','Currency for the returned prices.'=>'傳回價格的貨幣。','WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce detected an active cache plugin on your site.'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 在您的網站上偵測到啟用的快取外掛。','Caching may cause currency display issues for your customers if you are using the multicurrency feature.'=>'如果您正在使用多貨幣功能，快取可能會導致客戶的貨幣顯示問題。','To avoid this, set your cache plugin to not cache pages for visitors that have a cookie set in their browser.'=>'若要避免此問題，請將您的快取外掛設定為不針對瀏覽器中存有 Cookie 的訪客快取頁面。','Important: Action Needed for Your <b>Currency Switcher</b>'=>'重要：您的<b>貨幣切換器</b>需要採取行動','We detected that your site is using a <b>Currency Switcher</b> built with Twig templates. For security reasons, support for Twig-based templates will be discontinued in the upcoming version of WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 5.6.'=>'我們偵測到您的網站正在使用以 Twig 範本建置的<b>貨幣切換器</b>。基於安全性考量，即將推出的 WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 5.6 版本將停止支援以 Twig 為基礎的範本。','To ensure your <b>Currency Switcher</b> continues working smoothly:'=>'若要確保您的<b>貨幣切換器</b>繼續順暢運作：','- Switch to a PHP-based template - you can select one from the %1$sconfiguration page%2$s.'=>'- 切換到以 PHP 為基礎的範本 — 您可以從 %1$s設定頁面%2$s選擇一個。','- Need a custom solution? %1$sContact our support%2$s - we’re here to help you migrate safely.'=>'- 需要自訂解決方案？%1$s聯絡我們的支援團隊%2$s — 我們將協助您安全遷移。','We recommend updating your <b>Currency Switcher</b> as soon as possible to avoid disruptions when the new version of WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce is released.'=>'我們建議您儘快更新<b>貨幣切換器</b>，以避免新版 WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 發佈時發生中斷。','Migrating your multilingual shop? With %s you can transfer your translated content to a new site, including cross-sells, up-sells, and product attributes.'=>'正在遷移您的多語言商店嗎？透過 %s，您可以將翻譯後的內容轉移到新網站，包括交叉銷售、加碼銷售和商品屬性。','Looking to import your multilingual shop? With %1$s and %2$s in both your original and new site, you can export and import your translations automatically.'=>'想要匯入您的多語言商店嗎？只要在原始網站和新網站中都安裝 %1$s 和 %2$s，您就可以自動匯出和匯入翻譯。','WPML Export and Import'=>'WPML Export and Import','You haven\'t added any secondary currencies'=>'您尚未新增任何次要貨幣','Please add another currency to fully utilize multicurrency mode. If you do not need multiple currencies, you can disable this setting to improve your site\'s performance.'=>'請新增另一種貨幣以充分利用多貨幣模式。如果您不需要多種貨幣，可以停用此設定以提高網站效能。','Configure multicurrency mode'=>'設定多貨幣模式','Review WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce'=>'評論 WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce','Congrats on making your first multicurrency sale!'=>'恭喜您完成第一筆多貨幣訂單！','Want to help <strong>WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce</strong> plugin? %1$sGive us a review%2$s!'=>'想幫助 <strong>WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce</strong> 外掛嗎？%1$s給我們一個評論%2$s！','Currency - no orders found'=>'貨幣 - 找不到訂單','Invalid nonce'=>'無效的 Nonce','WPML synced translations for product-level changes only.'=>'WPML 僅針對商品層級的變更同步翻譯。','WPML synced translations for %1$d of %2$d variations.'=>'WPML 已同步 %2$d 個變化版本中 %1$d 個的翻譯。','%d other variation was not checked because its data didn\'t change here.'=>'未檢查其他 %d 個變化版本，因為它們的資料在此處沒有變更。','If you\'ve made changes <strong>outside this editor</strong> (for example, retranslating an attribute term), use <em>%s</em> below to make sure every translation is current.'=>'如果您在<strong>此編輯器之外</strong>進行了變更（例如重新翻譯屬性項目），請使用下方的<em>%s</em>以確保每個翻譯都是最新的。','Force update all'=>'強制更新全部','Force update all variation translations'=>'強制更新所有變化版本翻譯','You can switch to <em>"Always check all variations"</em> on the %s.'=>'您可以在 %s 切換到<em>「一律檢查所有變化版本」</em>。','WCML Settings page'=>'WCML 設定頁面','(opens in a new tab)'=>'（在新分頁中開啟）','Syncing all variations…'=>'正在同步所有變化版本…','Done — all variations synced'=>'完成 — 所有變化版本已同步','Sync completed for product #%d.'=>'商品 #%d 的同步已完成。','Failed — see console'=>'失敗 — 請查看主控台','Error — '=>'錯誤 — ','Dismiss'=>'關閉','WPML verified %1$d variation × %2$d language on this save. None of them had changes that needed syncing.'=>'WPML 在此次儲存中驗證了 %1$d 個變化版本 × %2$d 種語言。其中沒有任何需要同步的變更。','That\'s wasted work. Switching to <em>"Only sync variations edited in the editor"</em> would make saves like this much faster — WPML will only sync the variations you actually changed and tell you what was skipped.'=>'那是多餘的工作。切換到<em>「僅同步在編輯器中編輯過的變化版本」</em>會讓這類儲存速度快得多 — WPML 將僅同步您實際更改過的變化版本，並告知您跳過了哪些內容。','You can switch on the %s.'=>'您可以在 %s 切換。','Don\'t show this again on this site'=>'在此網站上不再顯示此訊息','Variation translation sync on product save'=>'儲存商品時同步變化版本翻譯','Choose how WPML updates variation translations when you save a variable product. Affects saves in the WooCommerce product editor only — Translation Dashboard and Translate Everything Automatically always run a complete sync.'=>'選擇當您儲存變化商品時，WPML 如何更新變化版本翻譯。這僅影響 WooCommerce 商品編輯器中的儲存 — 翻譯管理員和自動翻譯一律會執行完整同步。','Choose how WPML updates variation translations when you save a variable product.'=>'選擇當您儲存變化商品時，WPML 如何更新變化版本翻譯。','Affects saves in the WooCommerce product editor only. <b>Translation Dashboard</b> and <b>Translate Everything</b> Automatically always run a complete sync.'=>'僅影響 WooCommerce 商品編輯器中的儲存。<b>翻譯管理員</b>和<b>自動翻譯</b>一律會執行完整同步。','Always check all variations'=>'一律檢查所有變化版本','On every save, WPML checks every variation in every language and syncs anything that\'s out of date.'=>'每次儲存時，WPML 都會檢查每種語言中的每個變化版本，並同步任何過時的內容。','Only sync variations edited in the editor'=>'僅同步在編輯器中編輯過的變化版本','WPML syncs only the variations changed in this save. After each save, WPML shows what was synced and offers a one-click full sync.'=>'WPML 僅同步此次儲存中更改過的變化版本。每次儲存後，WPML 會顯示已同步的內容，並提供一鍵完整同步功能。','To translate custom WooCommerce email notifications, go to the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s.'=>'若要翻譯自訂 WooCommerce 電子郵件通知，請前往 %1$s翻譯管理員%2$s。','Monthly on the %s'=>'每月 %s','Weekly on %s'=>'每週 %s','Cannot get exchange rates. Connection failed.'=>'無法取得匯率。連線失敗。','Please note that the payment will be made in %1$s. Your total will be approximately %2$s, depending on the current exchange rate.'=>'請注意，付款將以 %1$s 進行。您的總額大約為 %2$s，具體取決於目前的匯率。','Not yet supported'=>'尚未支援','Set the currency in which your customer will see the final price when they checkout. Choose which accounts they will see in their payment message.'=>'設定客戶在結帳時看到的最終價格貨幣。選擇他們在付款訊息中會看到的帳戶。','Currency'=>'貨幣','Bank Account'=>'銀行帳戶','All Accounts'=>'所有帳戶','All in selected currency'=>'所選貨幣的所有帳戶','PayPal Email'=>'PayPal 電子郵件','Merchant ID'=>'商家 ID','Client ID'=>'用戶端 ID','Secret Key'=>'密鑰','This gateway does not support %s. To show this gateway please select another currency.'=>'此閘道不支援 %s。若要顯示此閘道，請選擇其他貨幣。','WPML could not read this payment from PayPal, so no refund was sent. Please try the refund again.'=>'WPML 無法從 PayPal 讀取此筆付款，因此未傳送退款。請再次嘗試退款。','The refund amount is too small to send to PayPal in the currency of the payment, so no refund was sent. Refund a larger amount, or record the refund manually in WooCommerce.'=>'退款金額太小，無法以該付款貨幣傳送至 PayPal，因此未傳送退款。請退還較大金額，或在 WooCommerce 中手動記錄退款。','WPML could not work out how much to refund on this order, so no refund was sent. Check the exchange rate for the order\'s currency in WPML\'s multicurrency settings, then try the refund again.'=>'WPML 無法計算此訂單的退款金額，因此未傳送退款。請在 WPML 的多貨幣設定中檢查該訂單貨幣的匯率，然後再次嘗試退款。','Live Publishable Key'=>'正式環境可發佈金鑰','Live Secret Key'=>'正式環境密鑰','Test Publishable Key'=>'測試環境可發佈金鑰','Test Secret Key'=>'測試環境密鑰','Connect with Stripe'=>'使用 Stripe 連線','Connect a test account'=>'連線測試帳戶','Reconnect with Stripe'=>'重新使用 Stripe 連線','Reconnect the test account'=>'重新連線測試帳戶','Connected with Stripe'=>'已與 Stripe 連線','You will continue on Stripe. Save your changes first. Anything unsaved on this screen is lost.'=>'您將在 Stripe 上繼續操作。請先儲存您的變更。此畫面上任何未儲存的內容都將遺失。','Stripe could not be connected. Please try again.'=>'無法連線 Stripe。請再試一次。','This payment is already refunded in full on Stripe, so no refund was sent. Record the refund manually in WooCommerce instead.'=>'此筆付款已在 Stripe 上全額退款，因此未傳送退款。請改在 WooCommerce 中手動記錄退款。','The refund amount is too small to send to Stripe in the currency of the payment, so no refund was sent. Refund a larger amount, or record the refund manually in WooCommerce.'=>'退款金額太小，無法以該付款貨幣傳送至 Stripe，因此未傳送退款。請退還較大金額，或在 WooCommerce 中手動記錄退款。','WPML could not read this payment from Stripe, so no refund was sent. Please try the refund again.'=>'WPML 無法從 Stripe 讀取此筆付款，因此未傳送退款。請再次嘗試退款。','PayPal took this payment in %1$s, and WooCommerce can only send a refund in %2$s. Refund this order in your PayPal account, then record it here with "Refund manually".'=>'PayPal 以 %1$s 收取此筆付款，而 WooCommerce 只能以 %2$s 傳送退款。請在您的 PayPal 帳戶中為此訂單退款，然後在此處使用「手動退款」進行記錄。','Language'=>'語言','Costs and values in custom currencies'=>'自訂貨幣的成本與數值','WPML Multilingual &