n.'=>'無法為 %s 連線 Stripe。請再試一次。','Currencies'=>'貨幣','Add currency'=>'新增貨幣','Rate'=>'匯率','default'=>'預設','Edit'=>'編輯','Currency displayed first'=>'優先顯示的貨幣','Choose which currency to display when a client switches languages'=>'選擇當客戶切換語言時要顯示哪種貨幣','Keep'=>'保留','Delete'=>'刪除','Currencies to display for each language'=>'每種語言顯示的貨幣','Add a secondary currency to choose which currencies appear for each language.'=>'新增次要貨幣以選擇每種語言出現的貨幣。','Enable %1$s for %2$s'=>'為 %2$s 啟用 %1$s','Disable %1$s for %2$s'=>'為 %2$s 停用 %1$s','Settings'=>'設定','Add new currency'=>'新增貨幣','Currency settings for %s'=>'%s 的貨幣設定','Select currency'=>'選擇貨幣','Exchange Rate'=>'匯率','Only numeric'=>'僅限數字','(previous value: %s)'=>'（先前數值：%s）','Currency Preview'=>'貨幣預覽','Currency Position'=>'貨幣位置','Left'=>'左側','Right'=>'右側','Left with space'=>'左側（附空格）','Right with space'=>'右側（附空格）','Thousand Separator'=>'千分位分隔符號','(Space)'=>'（空格）','Decimal Separator'=>'小數分隔符號','Number of Decimals'=>'小數位數','Rounding to the nearest integer'=>'捨入至最接近的整數','Disabled'=>'已停用','Up'=>'向上','Down'=>'向下','Nearest'=>'最接近','Increment for nearest integer'=>'最接近整數的增量','The resulting price will be an increment of this value after initial rounding.%se.g.:'=>'初始捨入後，產生的價格將是此數值的倍數。%s例如：','1454.07 &raquo; 1454 when set to 1'=>'當設定為 1 時，1454.07 &raquo; 1454','1454.07 &raquo; 1450 when set to 10'=>'當設定為 10 時，1454.07 &raquo; 1450','1454.07 &raquo; 1500 when set to 100'=>'當設定為 100 時，1454.07 &raquo; 1500','Round the converted price to the closest integer. %se.g. 15.78 becomes 16.00'=>'將轉換後的價格捨入至最接近的整數。%s例如 15.78 變為 16.00','The value to be subtracted from the amount obtained previously.'=>'要從先前獲得的金額中減去的數值。','For 1454.07, when the increment for the nearest integer is 100 and the auto-subtract amount is 1, the resulting amount is 1499.'=>'以 1454.07 為例，當最接近整數的增量為 100 且自動減去金額為 1 時，產生的金額為 1499。','Autosubtract amount'=>'自動減去金額','Payment Gateways'=>'付款閘道','Custom settings for %s'=>'%s 的自訂設定','Learn more'=>'了解更多','Please enter a valid number'=>'請輸入有效的數字','The currency was not saved. Try again.'=>'貨幣未儲存。請再試一次。','The setting was not saved. Try again.'=>'設定未儲存。請再試一次。','Cancel'=>'取消','Save'=>'儲存','Currency available in'=>'貨幣可用於','All countries'=>'所有國家/地區','All countries except: '=>'所有國家/地區，除了： ','All countries except...'=>'所有國家/地區，除了...','Specific countries'=>'特定國家/地區','Show currencies based on'=>'顯示貨幣依據','You need the WPML plugin to make your store multilingual and display currencies based on site language. Don\'t have it yet?'=>'您需要 WPML 外掛才能讓您的商店支援多語言，並根據網站語言顯示貨幣。還沒有嗎？','Purchase WPML now'=>'立即購買 WPML','Site Language'=>'網站語言','Client Location'=>'客戶所在地','Location based'=>'基於地點','WooCommerce integrates with MaxMind Geolocation to reliably determine the location of your customers.'=>'WooCommerce 與 MaxMind Geolocation 整合，可可靠地判斷客戶的位置。','Great! Now you can use Geolocation to determine default currency for chosen languages. You can edit that key in '=>'太棒了！現在您可以使用地理位置來判斷所選語言的預設貨幣。您可以在此處編輯該金鑰： ','WooCommerce settings page.'=>'WooCommerce 設定頁面。','MaxMind Licence Key'=>'MaxMind 授權金鑰','Apply'=>'套用','Please note: without a free MaxMind key, your geolocation calls will be limited and your site performance may be impacted.'=>'請注意：如果沒有免費的 MaxMind 金鑰，您的地理位置呼叫將受到限制，且您的網站效能可能會受到影響。','Learn how to generate a free license key'=>'了解如何產生免費授權金鑰','Set on %s'=>'設定於 %s','Country availability'=>'國家/地區可用性','All countries except'=>'所有國家/地區，除了','Configure per country availability for this payment gateway'=>'為此付款閘道設定各個國家/地區的可用性','Save changes'=>'儲存變更','Settings saved.'=>'設定已儲存。','Error saving settings.'=>'儲存設定時發生錯誤。','We noticed that you\'re using WooCommerce Gateways Country Limiter plugin which is now integrated into WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce. Please remove it!'=>'我們注意到您正在使用 WooCommerce Gateways Country Limiter 外掛，該外掛現在已整合到 WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 中。請將其移除！','To translate custom text for payment methods, go to the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s.'=>'若要翻譯付款方式的自訂文字，請前往 %1$s翻譯管理員%2$s。','To translate permalinks for product taxonomies, go to %1$sWPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce → Store URLs%2$s.'=>'若要翻譯商品分類法的永久連結，請前往 %1$sWPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce → 商店網址%2$s。','To translate product permalinks, go to %1$sWPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce → Store URLs%2$s.'=>'若要翻譯商品永久連結，請前往 %1$sWPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce → 基礎路徑%2$s。','How to translate permalinks for product taxonomies'=>'如何翻譯商品分類法的永久連結','How to translate product permalinks'=>'如何翻譯商品永久連結','Translate WooCommerce products'=>'翻譯 WooCommerce 商品','Translate shipping classes'=>'翻譯運送方式類別','Configure multicurrency for multilingual sites'=>'為多語言網站設定多貨幣','Translate endpoints'=>'翻譯端點','How to translate this?'=>'如何翻譯這個？','WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce will use cookies to understand the basket info when using languages in domains and to transfer data between the domains.'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 將使用 Cookie 來了解在網域中使用語言時的購物籃資訊，並在網域之間傳輸資料。','WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce will also use cookies to identify the language and currency of each customer’s order as well as the currency of the reports created by WooCommerce. WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce extends these reports by adding the currency’s information.'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 也將使用 Cookie 來識別每位客戶訂單的語言和貨幣，以及 WooCommerce 建立的報表貨幣。WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 透過加入貨幣資訊來擴充這些報表。','Invalid currency parameter: "%s"'=>'無效的貨幣參數：「%s」','Invalid language parameter: "%s"'=>'無效的語言參數：「%s」','Product not found: %d'=>'找不到商品：%d','Term not found: %d'=>'找不到項目：%d','Using "translation_of" requires providing a "lang" parameter too'=>'使用「translation_of」也需要提供「lang」參數','Multilingual'=>'多語言','Multicurrency'=>'多貨幣','To run your store in multiple languages, you need to use the %1$sWPML plugin%2$s.'=>'若要以多種語言執行您的商店，您需要使用 %1$sWPML 外掛%2$s。','If you have it already, install and activate it. Otherwise, %1$sbuy WPML%2$s.'=>'如果您已經擁有它，請安裝並啟用。否則，請 %1$s購買 WPML%2$s。','You will need either the Multilingual CMS or Multilingual Agency package to use WPML with WooCommerce.'=>'您需要 Multilingual CMS 或 Multilingual Agency 方案才能在 WooCommerce 中使用 WPML。','You can still use the %1$smulticurrency features%2$s without buying anything.'=>'您仍然可以無需購買任何產品就使用 %1$s多貨幣功能%2$s。','%s translation'=>'%s 翻譯','Translating %1$s? Use the %2$s table for easier translation.'=>'正在翻譯 %1$s？使用 %2$s 表格以更輕鬆地翻譯。','To translate product details, including their taxonomy, use this dashboard. If you need to translate taxonomy independently or adjust store and currency settings, visit: %1$sWPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce documentation%2$s.'=>'若要翻譯商品詳情（包括其分類法），請使用此管理介面。如果您需要獨立翻譯分類法或調整商店和貨幣設定，請造訪：%1$sWPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 說明文件%2$s。','To translate this content, go to the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s.'=>'若要翻譯此內容，請前往 %1$s翻譯管理員%2$s。','To see how to translate this text, save your changes here first.'=>'若要查看如何翻譯此文字，請先在此處儲存您的變更。','Header alignment for translations'=>'翻譯的頁首對齊方式','Automatically align email headers based on%slanguage direction (right-to-left or left-to-right).'=>'根據 %s 語言方向（由右至左或由左至右）自動對齊電子郵件頁首。','Off – use the "Header alignment" setting above'=>'關閉 – 使用上方的「頁首對齊方式」設定','On – align automatically'=>'開啟 – 自動對齊','Introduction'=>'簡介','Store Pages'=>'商店頁面','Global Attributes'=>'全域屬性','Multiple Currencies'=>'多貨幣','Tour Data'=>'商品資料','Title'=>'標題','Content'=>'內容','To translate the Method Title, go to the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s.'=>'若要翻譯方法標題，請前往 %1$s翻譯管理面板%2$s。','To translate Labels, go to the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s.'=>'若要翻譯標籤，請前往 %1$s翻譯管理面板%2$s。','To translate custom product fields, save your changes here first, then go to the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s.'=>'若要翻譯自訂商品欄位，請先在此儲存您的變更，然後前往 %1$s翻譯管理面板%2$s。','Calculate costs in other currencies automatically'=>'自動以其他貨幣計算成本','Set costs in other currencies manually'=>'手動設定其他貨幣的成本','Bookings'=>'預訂','Resources Label'=>'資源標籤','Resources'=>'資源','Person Types'=>'訪客類型','Person Type Name'=>'訪客類型名稱','Description'=>'說明','Resources label'=>'資源標籤','To translate Resources, go to the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s and send the associated product for translation.'=>'若要翻譯資源，請前往 %1$s翻譯管理面板%2$s 並傳送相關商品進行翻譯。','To translate Person Types, go to the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s and send the associated product for translation.'=>'若要翻譯訪客類型，請前往 %1$s翻譯管理面板%2$s 並傳送相關商品進行翻譯。','Booking currency'=>'預訂貨幣','Composite Products ( Components )'=>'複合商品（組件）','Name'=>'名稱','Composite Products ( Scenarios )'=>'複合商品（情境）','To translate global add-ons, go to the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s.'=>'若要翻譯全域加購項目，請前往 %1$s翻譯管理面板%2$s。','Product Add-ons Group "%s"'=>'商品加購項目群組「%s」','Placeholder'=>'預留位置','Options'=>'選項','Label'=>'標籤','To translate per-product add-ons, go to the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s and send the associated product for translation.'=>'若要翻譯個別商品的加購項目，請前往 %1$s翻譯管理面板%2$s 並傳送相關商品進行翻譯。','Multi-currency settings'=>'多貨幣設定','Calculate prices in other currencies automatically'=>'自動以其他貨幣計算價格','Set prices in other currencies manually'=>'手動設定其他貨幣的價格','Here you can set different prices for the %s in multiple currencies:'=>'您可以在此為 %s 設定多種貨幣的不同價格：','Product Bundles'=>'商品組合','You can translate text for subscription products from the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s.'=>'您可以在 %1$s翻譯管理面板%2$s 翻譯訂閱商品的文字。','Subscription Price'=>'訂閱價格','Sign-up Fee'=>'註冊費','Product tabs'=>'商品分頁','Heading'=>'標題','To translate custom per-product tabs, go to the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s and send the associated product for translation.'=>'若要翻譯個別商品的自訂分頁，請前往 %1$s翻譯管理面板%2$s 並傳送相關商品進行翻譯。','Custom Tabs'=>'自訂分頁','Tab Title'=>'分頁標題','Quick Edit isn\'t available for product translations:'=>'快速編輯不適用於商品翻譯：','- To edit this product\'s translation, use the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s.'=>'- 若要編輯此商品的翻譯，請使用 %1$s翻譯管理面板%2$s。','- To edit the original product, switch back to the default language.'=>'- 若要編輯原始商品，請切換回預設語言。','Multilingual Settings'=>'多語言設定','Multicurrency Settings'=>'多貨幣設定','It’s recommended that you translate products from the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s.'=>'建議您從 %1$s翻譯管理面板%2$s 翻譯商品。','WCML'=>'WCML','Shows a list of the products that existed in the cart before the cart is reset on the front end after switching the language or the currency. It will be hidden when there are no products to show.'=>'顯示在切換語言或貨幣後，購物車在前端重設前原本存在的商品列表。若沒有可顯示的商品，則會隱藏。','Products before cart reset'=>'購物車重設前的商品','Switching language?'=>'切換語言？','You\'ve switched the language and there are items in the cart. If you keep the %s language, the cart will be emptied and you will have to add the items again to the cart.'=>'您已切換語言，且購物車中已有項目。如果您保留 %s 語言，購物車將被清空，您必須重新將項目加入購物車。','Keep %s'=>'保留 %s','Switch back to %s'=>'切換回 %s','Reset cart option warning 1Because of some elements in your site configuration, when the users switch the currency or the language on the front end, the cart content might not be synchronized correctly.'=>'由於您的網站設定中包含某些元素，當使用者在前端切換貨幣或語言時，購物車內容可能無法正確同步。','Reset cart option warning 2It is recommended that you %s with the option to reset the cart in a situation like this.'=>'建議您在這種情況下 %s 並選擇重設購物車的選項。','configure WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce'=>'設定 WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce','More details'=>'更多詳細資訊','Switching currency?'=>'切換貨幣？','Your cart is not empty! After you switched the currency, all items from the cart will be removed and you have to add them again.'=>'您的購物車不是空的！切換貨幣後，購物車中的所有項目都將被移除，您必須重新加入。','Keep using %s'=>'繼續使用 %s','Proceed'=>'繼續','Show reviews in all languages  (%s)'=>'顯示所有語言的評論 (%s)','Show only reviews in %1$s (%2$s)'=>'僅顯示 %1$s 的評論 (%2$s)','translated'=>'已翻譯','Show original'=>'顯示原文','WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce is enabled but not effective. It is not compatible with  <a href="%1$s">WPML</a> versions prior %2$s.'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 已啟用但未生效。它與 %2$s 之前的 <a href="%1$s">WPML</a> 版本不相容。','WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce is enabled but not effective. Please finish the installation of WPML first.'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 已啟用但未生效。請先完成 WPML 的安裝。','WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce is enabled but not effective. It is not compatible with  <a href="%1$s">Woocommerce</a> versions prior %2$s.'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 已啟用但未生效。它與 %2$s 之前的 <a href="%1$s">WooCommerce</a> 版本不相容。','WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce is enabled but not effective. It is not compatible with  <a href="%1$s">WPML String Translation</a> versions prior %2$s.'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 已啟用但未生效。它與 %2$s 之前的 <a href="%1$s">WPML String Translation</a> 版本不相容。','WPML support'=>'WPML 支援','Default taxonomies must be translatable: 1/6Some taxonomies in your site are forced to be untranslatable. This is causing a problem when you\'re trying to run a multilingual WooCommerce site.'=>'您網站中的某些分類法被強制設定為不可翻譯。這在您嘗試執行多語言 WooCommerce 網站時會造成問題。','Default taxonomies must be translatable: 2/6A plugin or the theme are probably doing this.'=>'這可能是由外掛程式或佈景主題造成的。','Default taxonomies must be translatable: 3/6What you can do:'=>'您可以採取的行動：','Default taxonomies must be translatable: 4/61. Temporarily disable plugins and see if this message disappears.'=>'1. 暫時停用外掛程式，看看此訊息是否消失。','Default taxonomies must be translatable: 5/62. Temporarily switch the theme and see if this message disappears.'=>'2. 暫時切換佈景主題，看看此訊息是否消失。','Default taxonomies must be translatable: 6/6It\'s best to contact %s, tell that you\'re getting this message and offer to send a Duplicator copy of the site. We will work with the theme/plugin author and fix the problem for good. In the meanwhile, we\'ll give you a temporary solution, so you\'re not stuck.'=>'最好聯繫 %s，告知您收到此訊息，並提議傳送網站的 Duplicator 複本。我們將與佈景主題/外掛程式作者合作，徹底解決問題。同時，我們會提供您暫時的解決方案，讓您不會卡住。','and'=>'與','WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce is enabled but not effective. It requires %s in order to work.'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 已啟用但未生效。它需要 %s 才能運作。','Please %1$sactivate %2$s%3$s.'=>'請 %1$s啟用 %2$s%3$s。','WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce is enabled but not effective.'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 已啟用但未生效。','Because this site uses the default permalink structure, you cannot use slug translation for product permalinks.'=>'由於此網站使用預設的永久連結結構，您無法對商品永久連結使用代稱翻譯。','Please choose a different permalink structure or disable slug translation.'=>'請選擇不同的永久連結結構或停用代稱翻譯。','Permalink settings'=>'永久連結設定','Configure products slug translation'=>'設定商品代稱翻譯','wpml-config.xml file missing from WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce folder.'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 資料夾中缺少 wpml-config.xml 檔案。','Custom field %s configuration from wpml-config.xml file was altered!'=>'來自 wpml-config.xml 檔案的自訂欄位 %s 設定已被更改！','Custom type %s configuration from wpml-config.xml file was altered!'=>'來自 wpml-config.xml 檔案的自訂類型 %s 設定已被更改！','Custom taxonomy %s configuration from wpml-config.xml file was altered!'=>'來自 wpml-config.xml 檔案的自訂分類法 %s 設定已被更改！','We detected a problem in your WPML configuration: the %1$sproduct_type%2$s taxonomy is set as translatable and this would cause problems with translated products. You can fix this in the %3$sMultilingual Content Setup page%4$s.'=>'我們在您的 WPML 設定中偵測到一個問題：%1$sproduct_type%2$s 分類法被設定為可翻譯，這會導致翻譯商品出現問題。您可以在 %3$s多語言內容設定頁面%4$s 修正此問題。','We detected that the %1$sproduct_type%2$s field was set incorrectly for some product translations. This happened because the product_type taxonomy was translated. You can fix this in the WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce %3$stroubleshooting page%4$s.'=>'我們偵測到某些商品翻譯的 %1$sproduct_type%2$s 欄位設定不正確。這是因為 product_type 分類法已被翻譯。您可以在 WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce %3$s疑難排解頁面%4$s 修正此問題。','Downloading translations... Please don\'t close this page.'=>'正在下載翻譯... 請勿關閉此頁面。','Order language:'=>'訂單語言：','All the products will be removed from the current order in order to change the language'=>'為了更改語言，所有商品將從目前訂單中移除','Quick edit "%s" inline'=>'快速編輯「%s」','Quick Edit'=>'快速編輯','Your settings have been saved.'=>'您的設定已儲存。','You do not have permission to perform this action.'=>'您沒有執行此動作的權限。','Choose a file'=>'選擇檔案','At least one of these fields is required: title, content or excerpt'=>'至少需要其中一個欄位：標題、內容或摘要','This translation job will no longer be assigned to you. Other translators will be able take it and continue the translation.'=>'此翻譯工作將不再分配給您。其他翻譯者將能夠接手並繼續翻譯。','This field is locked for editing because WPML will copy its value from the original language.'=>'此欄位已鎖定編輯，因為 WPML 將從原始語言複製其值。','This is a translation of %1$s. Some of the fields are not editable. It\'s recommended that you translate products from the %2$sTranslation Dashboard%3$s.'=>'這是 %1$s 的翻譯。部分欄位無法編輯。建議您從 %2$s翻譯管理面板%3$s 翻譯商品。','Cart'=>'購物車','Checkout'=>'結帳','Checkout &rarr; Pay'=>'結帳 &rarr; 付款','Order Received'=>'已收到訂單','My Account'=>'我的帳戶','Change Password'=>'更改密碼','Edit My Address'=>'編輯我的地址','Logout'=>'登出','Lost Password'=>'忘記密碼','View Order'=>'查看訂單','Shop'=>'商店','To quickly translate this and other WooCommerce store pages, please run the %1$ssetup wizard%2$s.'=>'若要快速翻譯此頁面及其他 WooCommerce 商店頁面，請執行 %1$s設定精靈%2$s。','To translate %1$s please use the %2$s translation%3$s page, inside the %4$sWPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce admin%5$s.'=>'若要翻譯 %1$s，請使用 %4$sWPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 管理介面%5$s 內的 %2$s 翻譯%3$s 頁面。','%d products left'=>'剩餘 %d 個商品','Synchronization complete!'=>'同步完成！','Invalid taxonomy %s'=>'無效的分類法 %s','Some translated %1$s have different %2$s assignments.'=>'某些已翻譯的 %1$s 具有不同的 %2$s 指派。','Update %1$s for all translated %2$s'=>'為所有已翻譯的 %2$s 更新 %1$s','All %1$s have the same %2$s assignments.'=>'所有 %1$s 具有相同的 %2$s 指派。','Successfully updated %1$s for all translated %2$s.'=>'已成功為所有已翻譯的 %2$s 更新 %1$s。','Product Base'=>'商品基礎路徑','Product Tag Base'=>'商品標籤基礎路徑','Product Category Base'=>'商品分類基礎路徑','Product Attribute Base'=>'商品屬性基礎路徑','Attribute Slug'=>'屬性代稱','Endpoint: %s'=>'端點：%s','You are using the same value as for the regular category base. This is known to create conflicts resulting in urls not working properly.'=>'您使用的值與一般分類基礎路徑相同。這已知會產生衝突，導致 URL 無法正常運作。','To translate attributes, go to the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s and send the associated product for translation.'=>'若要翻譯屬性，請前往 %1$s翻譯管理面板%2$s 並傳送相關商品進行翻譯。','The default currency was changed. In order to show accurate prices in all currencies, you need to update the exchange rates under the %1$sMulti-currency%2$s configuration.'=>'預設貨幣已更改。為了在所有貨幣中顯示準確的價格，您需要更新 %1$s多貨幣%2$s 設定下的匯率。','Show all currencies'=>'顯示所有貨幣','Order currency:'=>'訂單貨幣：','All the products will be removed from the current order in order to change the currency'=>'為了更改貨幣，所有商品將從目前訂單中移除','Currencies order updated'=>'貨幣排序已更新','Uploads'=>'上傳','Currency switcher'=>'貨幣切換器','Customize the currency switcher'=>'自訂貨幣切換器','You haven\'t added any secondary currencies.'=>'您尚未新增任何次要貨幣。','Use custom settings for translations download files'=>'為翻譯下載檔案使用自訂設定','Use the same files for translations'=>'翻譯版本使用相同的檔案','Add separate download files for translations when you translate this product'=>'翻譯此商品時，為翻譯版本新增個別的下載檔案','You have untranslated terms!'=>'您有尚未翻譯的項目！','Store URLs'=>'商店 URL','Status'=>'狀態','Troubleshooting'=>'疑難排解','Translate Products'=>'翻譯商品','Go to WPML &rarr; Translation Dashboard to translate Products'=>'前往 WPML &rarr; 翻譯管理面板以翻譯商品','Translate Taxonomy'=>'翻譯分類法','Go to WPML &rarr; Taxonomy Translation to translate Taxonomy terms manually'=>'前往 WPML &rarr; 分類法翻譯以手動翻譯分類項目','Prefer to translate manually?'=>'偏好手動翻譯？','To manually translate products, go to %1$sProducts%2$s and click on the "plus" icon.'=>'若要手動翻譯商品，請前往 %1$s商品%2$s 並按一下「加號」圖示。','To manually translate product categories, tags and attributes, go to %1$sWPML &rarr; Taxonomy Translation%2$s.'=>'若要手動翻譯商品分類、標籤和屬性，請前往 %1$sWPML &rarr; 分類法翻譯%2$s。','Translation'=>'翻譯','Translate the WooCommerce slugs (Shop, Product base, etc.) at WPML → Translations → Store URLs.'=>'在 WPML → 翻譯 → 商店 URL 翻譯 WooCommerce 代稱（商店、商品基礎路徑等）。','Open Store URLs ›'=>'開啟商店 URL ›','Go to WPML → Translations → Dashboard to translate Products.'=>'前往 WPML → 翻譯 → 管理面板以翻譯商品。','Translate Products ›'=>'翻譯商品 ›','Translate product taxonomies'=>'翻譯商品分類法','Go to WPML → Translations → Taxonomy to translate product categories, tags and attributes.'=>'前往 WPML → 翻譯 → 分類法以翻譯商品分類、標籤和屬性。','Translate Taxonomies ›'=>'翻譯分類法 ›','Products, media, downloads, reviews, cart and the variation translation sync — all in WPML → Settings → WCML.'=>'商品、媒體、下載、評論、購物車和變化版本翻譯同步 — 盡在 WPML → 設定 → WCML。','Open WCML Settings ›'=>'開啟 WCML 設定 ›','Configure currencies, exchange rates and currency switchers at WPML → Settings → Multicurrency.'=>'在 WPML → 設定 → 多貨幣設定貨幣、匯率和貨幣切換器。','Open Multicurrency ›'=>'開啟多貨幣 ›','Support'=>'支援','WCML status'=>'WCML 狀態','Diagnostic checks for store pages, products, taxonomies, multicurrency and plugins.'=>'商店頁面、商品、分類法、多貨幣和外掛程式的診斷檢查。','Open WCML status ›'=>'開啟 WCML 狀態 ›','Fix WCML translations'=>'修復 WCML 翻譯','Safe bulk tools to sync product variations, galleries and stock; register missing reviews; create missing attribute translations.'=>'用於同步商品變化版本、圖庫和庫存的安全批次工具；註冊遺漏的評論；建立遺漏的屬性翻譯。','Open Fix WCML translations ›'=>'開啟修復 WCML 翻譯 ›','WCML configuration log'=>'WCML 設定記錄','Read-only snapshot of the WCML configuration. Copy when WPML Support asks.'=>'WCML 設定的唯讀快照。當 WPML 支援要求時請複製。','Open WCML configuration log ›'=>'開啟 WCML 設定記錄 ›','WCML translation maintenance'=>'WCML 翻譯維護','Advanced repair tools — only run when WPML Support asks you to.'=>'進階修復工具 — 僅在 WPML 支援要求時執行。','Open WCML translation maintenance ›'=>'開啟 WCML 翻譯維護 ›','WPML is installed on this site, so WCML\'s controls have moved into WPML. Pick the area you need.'=>'此網站已安裝 WPML，因此 WCML 的控制項已移至 WPML 中。請選擇您需要的區域。','Translatable?'=>'可翻譯？','Enable this if you want to translate attribute values with WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce'=>'如果您想使用 WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 翻譯屬性值，請啟用此項','Existing translations and variations associated will be deleted.'=>'現有的翻譯和相關的變化版本將被刪除。','Products removed after switching to %s:'=>'切換至 %s 後移除的商品：','Clear list'=>'清除列表','Products Synchronization'=>'商品同步','Configure specific product properties that should be synced to translations.'=>'設定應同步至翻譯版本的特定商品屬性。','Sync publishing date for translated products.'=>'為翻譯商品同步發佈日期。','Sync products and product taxonomies order.'=>'同步商品和商品分類法的排序。','Products Media Synchronization'=>'商品媒體同步','Configure thumbnail and gallery synchronization to translations.'=>'設定縮圖和圖庫同步至翻譯版本。','Display original images on the translated product front page if images not specified'=>'如果未指定圖片，則在翻譯商品的前端頁面顯示原始圖片','Products Download Files'=>'商品下載檔案','If you are using downloadable products, you can choose to have their paths
                                            synchronized, or seperate for each language.'=>'如果您正在使用可下載商品，您可以選擇讓它們的路徑
同步，或為每種語言分別設定。','Add separate download files for translations when translating products'=>'翻譯商品時為翻譯版本新增個別的下載檔案','Product reviews'=>'商品評論','Define how to display product reviews on the product page by default. The customer will be still able to filter reviews by language.'=>'定義預設如何在商品頁面上顯示商品評論。客戶仍能按語言篩選評論。','By default, show reviews in all languages'=>'預設顯示所有語言的評論','You can choose to clear the cart contents when you change language or currency in case you have problems in cart or checkout page'=>'如果您在購物車或結帳頁面遇到問題，可以選擇在更改語言或貨幣時清空購物車內容','Switching languages when there are items in the cart'=>'購物車中有項目時切換語言','Synchronize cart content when switching languages'=>'切換語言時同步購物車內容','Prompt for a confirmation and reset the cart'=>'提示確認並重設購物車','Switching currencies when there are items in the cart'=>'當購物車內有商品時切換貨幣','Synchronize cart content when switching currencies'=>'切換貨幣時同步購物車內容','This feature was disabled. Please enable %1$sWPML cookies%2$s to continue.'=>'此功能已停用。請啟用 %1$sWPML Cookie%2$s 以繼續。','Not sure which option to choose? Read about %1$spotential issues when switching languages and currencies while the cart has items%2$s.'=>'不確定要選擇哪個選項？請閱讀關於%1$s當購物車內有商品時切換語言和貨幣的潛在問題%2$s。','Product Translation Interface'=>'商品翻譯介面','The recommended way is using the WPML Translation Editor. It is streamlined for making the translation process much easier while also providing a much better integration with various WooCommerce extensions.'=>'建議使用 WPML 翻譯編輯器。它經過精簡，可讓翻譯過程更加輕鬆，同時也與各種 WooCommerce 擴充功能提供更好的整合。','WPML Translation Editor'=>'WPML 翻譯編輯器','Native WooCommerce product editing screen'=>'原生 WooCommerce 商品編輯畫面','If you are using a page builder to design WooCommerce products, you should only use WPML\'s Translation Editor.'=>'如果您使用頁面編輯器來設計 WooCommerce 商品，您應該只使用 WPML 的翻譯編輯器。','OK (translate with the WordPress editor)'=>'確定 (使用 WordPress 編輯器翻譯)','Cancel (stay with the Translation Editor)'=>'取消 (留在翻譯編輯器)','Set different slugs in different languages for %s on WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce URLs translations page'=>'在 WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 網址翻譯頁面上為 %s 設定不同語言的不同代稱','To translate the attribute slug, please set the option "Enable archives?" for the attribute %s in WooCommerce'=>'若要翻譯屬性代稱，請在 WooCommerce 中為屬性 %s 設定「啟用彙整頁面？」選項','Synchronize attributes and update product variations'=>'同步屬性並更新商品變化版本','This will automatically generate variations for translated products corresponding to recently translated attributes.'=>'這將為對應最近翻譯屬性的翻譯商品自動產生變化版本。','Currently, there are %s variations that need to be created.'=>'目前有 %s 個變化版本需要建立。','Synchronize %s assignment in content'=>'同步內容中的 %s 指派','This action lets you automatically apply the %s taxonomy to your content in different languages. It will scan the original content and apply the same taxonomy to translated content.'=>'此動作可讓您自動將 %s 分類法套用至不同語言的內容。它將掃描原始內容，並將相同的分類法套用至翻譯後的內容。','Please make a backup of your database before using these tools'=>'在使用這些工具之前，請先備份您的資料庫','There are <strong>%s product(s)</strong> in total.'=>'總共有 <strong>%s 個商品</strong>。','There are <strong>%s product(s)</strong> with variations.'=>'有 <strong>%s 個商品</strong>具有變化版本。','There are <strong>%s variation(s)</strong> in total.'=>'總共有 <strong>%s 個變化版本</strong>。','Synchronize data into translations'=>'將資料同步至翻譯中','Synchronize product variations'=>'同步商品變化版本','Synchronize products image galleries'=>'同步商品圖片庫','Synchronize metadata for product categories (display type, thumbnail)'=>'同步商品分類的中繼資料 (顯示類型、縮圖)','Synchronize stock for products and product variations'=>'同步商品及商品變化版本的庫存','Fix multilingual information'=>'修正多語言資訊','Fix incorrect or missing translation links for product variations'=>'修正商品變化版本錯誤或遺失的翻譯連結','Fix product taxonomies'=>'修正商品分類法','Set product types as not translatable and delete unwanted translations'=>'將商品類型設為不可翻譯並刪除不需要的翻譯','Create missing translations for product attributes:'=>'為商品屬性建立遺失的翻譯：','To translate product taxonomies, go to the %1$sTaxonomy Translation%2$s page.'=>'若要翻譯商品分類法，請前往 %1$s分類法翻譯%2$s 頁面。','none'=>'無','Fix missing product reviews'=>'修正遺失的商品評論','Allow to translate missing product reviews'=>'允許翻譯遺失的商品評論','To translate product reviews, go to the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s.'=>'若要翻譯商品評論，請前往 %1$s翻譯管理面板%2$s。','Cleanup tools'=>'清理工具','Remove unused custom fields from product and variation translations'=>'從商品和變化版本翻譯中移除未使用的自訂欄位','Run the selected tools'=>'執行選取的工具','Processing'=>'處理中','WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce settings'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 設定','%s items processed'=>'已處理 %s 個項目','Processing...'=>'處理中...','Completed'=>'已完成','Something went wrong, please reload the page and try again'=>'發生錯誤，請重新載入頁面並再試一次','Clear all colors'=>'清除所有顏色','Gray'=>'灰色','White'=>'白色','Blue'=>'藍色','Border'=>'邊框','Current currency font color'=>'目前貨幣字體顏色','Other currency font color'=>'其他貨幣字體顏色','Current currency background color'=>'目前貨幣背景顏色','Other currency background color'=>'其他貨幣背景顏色','Currency switcher style'=>'貨幣切換器樣式','Core'=>'核心','Custom'=>'自訂','Allowed HTML tags: <img> <span> <u> <strong> <em>'=>'允許的 HTML 標籤：<img> <span> <u> <strong> <em>','Template for currency switcher'=>'貨幣切換器範本','Available parameters'=>'可用參數','Default: %name% (%1$symbol%) - %2$code%'=>'預設：%name% (%1$symbol%) - %2$code%','Hide more'=>'隱藏更多','You can customize the currency switcher template using these parameters:'=>'您可以使用這些參數自訂貨幣切換器範本：','%1$s: Full name of the currency (e.g., “Euro”).'=>'%1$s：貨幣全名 (例如：「Euro」)。','%1$s: Standard symbol representing the currency (e.g., “$” or “€”).'=>'%1$s：代表貨幣的標準符號 (例如：「$」或「€」)。','%1$s: Standard code representing the currency (e.g., USD for United States Dollar).'=>'%1$s：代表貨幣的標準代碼 (例如：USD 代表美元)。','Additionally, you can use HTML tags %1$s(img, span, em, strong, u)%2$s to customize the output when the switcher style is set to %1$sList of currencies%2$s, %3$sin line with official HTML standards for the select tag%4$s.'=>'此外，當切換器樣式設定為 %1$s貨幣列表%2$s 時，您可以使用 HTML 標籤 %1$s(img, span, em, strong, u)%2$s 來自訂輸出，%3$s這符合 select 標籤的官方 HTML 標準%4$s。','Currency switcher colors'=>'貨幣切換器顏色','Color theme'=>'色彩佈景主題','Normal'=>'一般','Hover'=>'懸停','Select a preset'=>'選取預設值','Widget area'=>'小工具區域','Widget title'=>'小工具標題','-- Choose a widget area --'=>'-- 選擇小工具區域 --','Preview'=>'預覽','Regular Price'=>'定價','Sale Price'=>'特價','Multi-currency is enabled, but no secondary currencies have been set. %1$sAdd secondary currency%2$s.'=>'多貨幣已啟用，但尚未設定次要貨幣。%1$s新增次要貨幣%2$s。','Click to see the prices in the other currencies as they are currently shown on the front end.'=>'按一下以查看目前在前台顯示的其他貨幣價格。','Show'=>'顯示','Hide'=>'隱藏','Enter prices in other currencies'=>'輸入其他貨幣的價格','Hide prices in other currencies'=>'隱藏其他貨幣的價格','Determined automatically based on exchange rate'=>'根據匯率自動決定','Schedule'=>'排程','Same as default currency'=>'與預設貨幣相同','Set dates'=>'設定日期','Collapse'=>'收合','From&hellip;'=>'從&hellip;','To&hellip;'=>'至&hellip;','Please enter in a value less than the regular price'=>'請輸入小於定價的數值','never'=>'從未','Automatic Exchange Rates'=>'自動匯率','Enable automatic exchange rates'=>'啟用自動匯率','Exchange rates source'=>'匯率來源','Lifting charge'=>'額外手續費','The lifting charge adjusts the exchange rate provided by the selected service before it is saved. The exchange rates displayed in the table above include the lifting charge.'=>'額外手續費會在儲存前調整所選服務提供的匯率。上方表格中顯示的匯率已包含額外手續費。','Exchange rate = %s exchange rate x (1 + lifting charge / 100)'=>'匯率 = %s 匯率 x (1 + 額外手續費 / 100)','API key (required)'=>'API 金鑰 (必填)','Update frequency'=>'更新頻率','Update manually now'=>'立即手動更新','You have to save all settings before updating exchange rates'=>'您必須在更新匯率前儲存所有設定','Manually'=>'手動','Hourly'=>'每小時','Daily'=>'每日','Weekly on'=>'每週於','Monthly on the'=>'每月於第','Enter API key'=>'輸入 API 金鑰','WARNING! Minor limitations include 1000 requests/month limit and EUR being the only available base currency for customers using a free account. If you need more than 1000 requests per month or want to use all 170 available base currencies, you’ll need to choose one of the paid plans starting at only $10 per month.'=>'警告！次要限制包括每月 1000 次請求限制，且使用免費帳戶的客戶僅能以 EUR 作為可用基礎貨幣。如果您每月需要超過 1000 次請求或想要使用所有 170 種可用的基礎貨幣，您需要選擇付費方案，每月僅需 $10 起。','Updating the exchange rates on an hourly basis generates around 744 API calls a month. Please check that your exchange rates source can accommodate this higher usage.'=>'按小時更新匯率每月會產生約 744 次 API 呼叫。請檢查您的匯率來源是否能容納此較高的使用量。','Last updated: %s'=>'最後更新：%s','Exchange rates updated successfully'=>'匯率更新成功','Visit website'=>'造訪網站','Enable/disable'=>'啟用/停用','The multi-currency mode cannot be enabled as a specific currency was not set. Go to the %1$sWooCommerce settings%2$s page and select the default currency for your store.'=>'由於未設定特定貨幣，因此無法啟用多貨幣模式。請前往 %1$sWooCommerce 設定%2$s 頁面並為您的商店選擇預設貨幣。','Enable the multicurrency mode'=>'啟用多貨幣模式','Multicurrency documentation'=>'多貨幣說明文件','Custom prices'=>'自訂價格','Show only products with %1$scustom prices%2$s in secondary currencies'=>'僅顯示在次要貨幣中具有%1$s自訂價格%2$s的商品','When enabled, products with prices based on the exchange rate are hidden'=>'啟用時，將隱藏根據匯率定價的商品','The changes you made will be lost if you navigate away from this page.'=>'如果您離開此頁面，您所做的變更將會遺失。','At least one currency must be enabled for this language!'=>'此語言必須至少啟用一種貨幣！','Currency switcher options'=>'貨幣切換器選項','All currency switchers in your site are affected by the settings in this section.'=>'您網站中的所有貨幣切換器都會受此區段中的設定影響。','Order of currencies'=>'貨幣排序','Additional CSS'=>'額外 CSS','Widget Currency Switcher'=>'小工具貨幣切換器','Product page Currency Switcher'=>'商品頁面貨幣切換器','Position'=>'位置','Actions'=>'動作','Action'=>'動作','Edit currency switcher'=>'編輯貨幣切換器','Add a new currency switcher to a widget area'=>'新增貨幣切換器至小工具區域','Your theme does not support a currency switcher widget. Please %1$sadd your currency switcher%2$s using a shortcode or PHP.'=>'您的佈景主題不支援貨幣切換器小工具。請使用短代碼或 PHP %1$s新增您的貨幣切換器%2$s。','Currency switcher preview'=>'貨幣切換器預覽','Drag and drop the currencies to change their order'=>'拖放貨幣以更改其排序','Show a currency switcher on the product page template'=>'在商品頁面範本上顯示貨幣切換器','Edit Product Currency Switcher'=>'編輯商品貨幣切換器','New Widget Area Currency Switcher'=>'新增小工具區域貨幣切換器','Edit %s Currency Switcher'=>'編輯 %s 貨幣切換器','Which product attributes should be translatable?'=>'哪些商品屬性應該是可翻譯的？','WPML allows you to %1$stranslate your product attributes%2$s. Some attributes, like the ones based on numbers and codes, can be universal and might not need to be translated.'=>'WPML 允許您%1$s翻譯您的商品屬性%2$s。某些屬性 (例如基於數字和代碼的屬性) 可能是通用的，可能不需要翻譯。','Select which attributes in your store should be translatable:'=>'請選擇您商店中哪些屬性應該是可翻譯的：','There are no attributes defined'=>'尚未定義任何屬性','Continue'=>'繼續','Go back'=>'返回','WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce › Setup Wizard'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce › Setup Wizard','Let\'s make your WooCommerce store multilingual'=>'讓我們將您的 WooCommerce 商店變更為多語言','To get started, we need to set up the following:'=>'若要開始，我們需要設定以下內容：','Create store pages in all your site\'s languages'=>'在您網站的所有語言中建立商店頁面','Choose which product attributes you want to translate'=>'選擇您想要翻譯的商品屬性','Set your translation options'=>'設定您的翻譯選項','Decide if you want to add multiple currencies to your store'=>'決定是否要為您的商店新增多種貨幣','Let\'s continue'=>'讓我們繼續','I\'ll do the setup later'=>'我稍後再進行設定','Do you want to add more currencies to your store?'=>'您想要為您的商店新增更多貨幣嗎？','You will be able to:'=>'您將能夠：','Add a currency switcher to your store'=>'為您的商店新增貨幣切換器','Set exchange rates'=>'設定匯率','Create custom pricing in each currency'=>'在每種貨幣中建立自訂定價','And more!'=>'以及更多！','Yes, enable multicurrency mode'=>'是，啟用多貨幣模式','No, use only one currency'=>'否，僅使用一種貨幣','Make your store multilingual'=>'使您的商店成為多語言','Set up %1$sWPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce%2$s to translate your store and add more currencies.'=>'設定 %1$sWPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce%2$s 以翻譯您的商店並新增更多貨幣。','Start the Setup Wizard'=>'啟動 Setup Wizard','Click continue to create missing WooCommerce pages translate your store pages into the following languages:'=>'按一下繼續以建立遺失的 WooCommerce 頁面，並將您的商店頁面翻譯成以下語言：','Click continue to translate your store pages into the following languages:'=>'按一下繼續以將您的商店頁面翻譯成以下語言：','WPML automatically generates translated versions of default WooCommerce pages, such as Shop, Account, Checkout, and Cart.'=>'WPML 會自動產生預設 WooCommerce 頁面的翻譯版本，例如商店、帳戶、結帳和購物車。','Configuration Warnings'=>'配置警告','Your product permalink base is not translated to:'=>'您的商品永久連結基礎路徑尚未翻譯為：','Translate URLs'=>'翻譯網址','Running WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce with default language other than English.'=>'正在以非英文的預設語言執行 WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce。','This may cause problems with URLs in different languages.'=>'這可能會導致不同語言的網址出現問題。','Change default language'=>'變更預設語言','There are some settings that require careful attention.'=>'有一些設定需要仔細留意。','Some settings from the WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce wpml-config.xml file have been overwritten.'=>'來自 WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce wpml-config.xml 檔案的部分設定已被覆寫。','You should check WPML configuration files added by other plugins or manual settings on the %s section.'=>'您應該檢查由其他外掛程式新增的 WPML 設定檔，或 %s 區段中的手動設定。','Multilingual Content Setup'=>'多語言內容設定','Media'=>'媒體','%s is not active.'=>'%s 未啟用。','%s is not required in order to run WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce but it’s recommended if you want to use separate product images and galleries for different languages.'=>'執行 WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 並不需要 %s，但如果您想為不同語言使用個別的商品圖片和圖片庫，建議安裝此程式。','%s is installed and active.'=>'%s 已安裝並啟用。','Secondary currencies: %s'=>'次要貨幣：%s','Multi-currency is not enabled.'=>'多貨幣未啟用。','Add Currencies'=>'新增貨幣','Products Missing Translations'=>'商品缺少翻譯','%1$d %2$s translation missing.'=>'%1$d 個 %2$s 翻譯遺失。','%1$d %2$s translations missing.'=>'%1$d 個 %2$s 翻譯遺失。','Right now, there are no products needing translation.'=>'目前沒有需要翻譯的商品。','Plugins Status'=>'外掛程式狀態','%s is set up.'=>'%s 已設定。','%s is not set up.'=>'%s 未設定。','WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce depends on several plugins to work. If any required plugin is missing, you should install and activate it.'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 需要依賴多個外掛程式才能運作。如果缺少任何必要的外掛程式，您應該安裝並啟用它。','WooCommerce Store Pages'=>'WooCommerce 商店頁面','To run a multilingual e-commerce site, you need to have the WooCommerce shop pages translated to all the site\'s languages. Once all the pages are installed you can add the translations for them from this menu.'=>'若要執行多語言電子商務網站，您需要將 WooCommerce 商店頁面翻譯成網站的所有語言。安裝所有頁面後，您可以從此選單為其新增翻譯。','One or more WooCommerce pages have not been created.'=>'一或多個 WooCommerce 頁面尚未建立。','Install WooCommerce Pages'=>'安裝 WooCommerce 頁面','WooCommerce store pages do not exist for these languages:'=>'這些語言尚不存在 WooCommerce 商店頁面：','Create missing translations'=>'建立缺失的翻譯','These pages are currently being translated by translators via WPML: '=>'這些頁面目前正由翻譯人員透過 WPML 進行翻譯： ','WooCommerce store pages are translated to all the site\'s languages.'=>'WooCommerce 商店頁面已翻譯為網站的所有語言。','Taxonomies Missing Translations'=>'分類法缺失翻譯','To run a fully translated site, you should translate all taxonomy terms. Some store elements, such as variations, depend on taxonomy translation.'=>'若要執行完整翻譯的網站，您應該翻譯所有分類法項目。某些商店元素（例如變化版本）取決於分類法翻譯。','%s do not require translation.'=>'%s 不需要翻譯。','This taxonomy requires translation.'=>'此分類法需要翻譯。','%1$d %2$s is missing translations.'=>'%1$d 個 %2$s 缺失翻譯。','%1$d %2$s are missing translations.'=>'%1$d 個 %2$s 缺失翻譯。','Translate %s'=>'翻譯 %s','This taxonomy does not require translation.'=>'此分類法不需要翻譯。','All %s are translated.'=>'所有 %s 均已翻譯。','Right now, there are no taxonomy terms needing translation.'=>'目前沒有需要翻譯的分類法項目。','To configure product taxonomies or attributes as translatable or not translatable, go to the %1$sMultilingual Content Setup%2$s'=>'若要將商品分類法或屬性設定為可翻譯或不可翻譯，請前往 %1$s多語言內容設定%2$s','Original'=>'原文','Translation to'=>'翻譯至','Product Shop Base'=>'商品商店基礎路徑','Original language'=>'原始語言','Update translation'=>'更新翻譯','Add translation'=>'新增翻譯','Edit translation'=>'編輯翻譯','This page allows you to translate all strings that are being used by WooCommerce in building different type of urls. Translating them enables you to have fully localized urls that match the language of the pages.'=>'此頁面允許您翻譯 WooCommerce 在建立不同類型 URL 時使用的所有字串。翻譯這些字串可讓您擁有與頁面語言相符的完全在地化 URL。','You can enter or edit your default values on the %1$sPermalinks settings%2$s page or, for the endpoints, on the WooCommerce %3$sAdvanced settings%4$s page.'=>'您可以在 %1$s永久連結設定%2$s 頁面輸入或編輯您的預設值，或者針對端點，在 WooCommerce %3$s進階設定%4$s 頁面進行設定。','permalinks settings'=>'永久連結設定','Account settings'=>'帳戶設定','Slug type'=>'代稱類型','Original Slug'=>'原始代稱','Shop page'=>'商店頁面','Product base'=>'商品基礎路徑','Product category base'=>'商品分類基礎路徑','Product tag base'=>'商品標籤基礎路徑','Product attribute base'=>'商品屬性基礎路徑','Attribute slug: %s'=>'屬性代稱：%s','Product'=>'商品','Slug'=>'代稱','Content / Description'=>'內容 / 說明','Excerpt'=>'摘要','Purchase note'=>'購買備註','Images'=>'圖片','Custom Product attributes'=>'自訂商品屬性','Value(s)'=>'數值','Custom Fields'=>'自訂欄位','Variations data'=>'變化版本資料','Download Files for Variation #%s'=>'下載變化版本 #%s 的檔案','Download Files'=>'下載檔案','File URL'=>'檔案 URL','External Product'=>'外部商品','Product url'=>'商品 URL','Button text'=>'按鈕文字','Changes in these translations will affect terms in general! ( Not only for this product )'=>'這些翻譯的變更將會影響一般的項目！（不只是此商品）','Content, title, and excerpt are empty.'=>'內容、標題與摘要皆為空白。']];